## The Bottom Line

`batch_runner.py` is a documented, checkpointed, quality-filtered pipeline that turns prompt datasets into ShareGPT-format trajectories with tool statistics. It suits training-data generation and standardized evaluation, and resume-by-text-content is its standout robustness feature. Two caveats apply: this guide was not hands-on tested, and cost grows with prompt count.

- Confirm the batch_runner.py source location yourself, since the batch page does not document it.
- Verify the developer-guide [trajectory-format reference](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/docs/developer-guide/trajectory-format) before relying on downstream format details.

